<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-DPL started neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-DPL started neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of DPL Inc with a neutral rating on Thursday, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat at 23-1/2 in early trading.</p>
